Package: GSE142512
Type: Package
Title: GSE142512 DNA Methylation ExperimentHub Data
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-07-06
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Paul",
    family = "Ruiz Pinto",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ruizpint@qut.edu.au",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6714-3566"))
Description: Provides ExperimentHub access to processed DNA methylation
    resources derived from GEO accession GSE142512. The resources contain
    Illumina HumanMethylation450 and Infinium MethylationEPIC data represented
    as RangedSummarizedExperiment objects with beta, M, and CN assays, hg19
    genomic ranges, and sample phenotype metadata.
URL: https://github.com/paulYRP/GSE142512
